                                "sense_id": "bf17ba6a-ca5b-3738-b054-e6b2e0e2658b",
                                "text": "[He] greeted Blowitz with warmth and apologized for having failed in his joint request with Hohenlohe to get Bismarck to unchest the Treaty."
